---
import Starfield from './Starfield.astro';
---
<section class="about section-block" id="about">
  <Starfield />
  <div class="about__copy reveal">
    <p class="section-label">About Grashof</p>
    <div class="red-rule"></div>
    <h2>Current Work.<br />Future R&amp;D.</h2>
    <p class="about__lead">格拉索提供視覺 AI、完整熱流解決方案，以及客製 AI 與 API 應用</p>
    <p>未來研發聚焦衛星熱管理與太空電磁干擾防護</p>
  </div>

  <div class="about__layers reveal">
    <article><span>CORE</span><h3>Applied AI</h3><p>Camera data, engineering models, and operational data</p></article>
    <article><span>CURRENT WORK</span><h3>Vision AI · Thermal-Fluid Solutions · Custom AI Systems</h3><p>Requirements, system design, integration, and deployment</p></article>
    <article><span>FUTURE R&amp;D</span><h3>Satellite Thermal · EMI Protection</h3><p>Thermal-control hardware and electronics packaging</p></article>
  </div>

  <dl class="company-facts reveal">
    <div><dt>Legal entity</dt><dd>格拉索工業有限公司</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Brand</dt><dd>Grashof</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Based in</dt><dd>Taiwan</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Focus</dt><dd>Applied AI Engineering</dd></div>
  </dl>
  <span class="section-number">05 / 06</span>
</section>
